Re-cap of steps used to get the Stellar crawler to work:

	# needed to install corepack

	sudo npm install corepack

	# and then to get pnpm

	corepack enable pnpm

	# then in the repo run

	pnpm install
	pnpm build


To run the crawler, go into 'crawler' directory and run

node crawl.js $PATH to seed nodes file$
